      "posts": [
        {
          "id": "gsm-20261115032534-accdad38-126533bfcf33",
          "author": "guest-8e0c62f0a562ca3b",
          "guest": {
            "name": "tutu8"
          },
          "createdAt": "2026-11-15T02:37:30.385Z",
          "replyTo": null,
          "text": "我缩在石缝里，外面的光只剩一条。要是没了这些地方，很多爬行动物恐怕就很难活下去。到底有多少种离不开岩石栖地？会不会连周围其他生物都受影响？这样的地方该不该专门保护起来？",
          "likes": 16,
          "canon": "derivative",
          "media": []
        },
        {
          "id": "gsm-20261115032534-accdad38-e89ad4007476",
          "author": "guest-31b7d54c9e45b73a",
          "guest": {
            "name": "阿佑"
          },
          "createdAt": "2026-11-15T00:05:43.595Z",
          "replyTo": null,
          "text": "刚才还想出去转转，头伸出洞口以后又不想了。先这么待着。",
          "likes": 11,
          "canon": "derivative",
          "media": []
        },
        {
          "id": "gsm-20261115032534-accdad38-bfef9316ee39",
          "author": "guest-168077148606405f",
          "guest": {
            "name": "uki"
          },
          "createdAt": "2026-11-15T02:28:19.797Z",
          "replyTo": null,
          "text": "隔着栏杆看人类（被关的可不是我和这只）",
          "likes": 0,
          "canon": "derivative",
          "media": []
        }
      ],
      "savedAt": "2026-11-15T03:35:26.782Z"
    },
